      "writtenOn": "2019-06-17T17:31:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately the most chatty partners tend to be PD3.0 during \"Extended\" status queries, which is not currently supported on this platform.\n\nI would say the closest would be a Zinger 60w that hasn\u0027t been FW updated yet.\n\nFor another real-world example, you can the traffic between a Macbook and 87w charger when negotiating its serial number. There are a significant amount of back-and-forth queries in a short period, which is completely valid per the spec. (But again, we don\u0027t utilize this \"Apple\" AltMode, so it is informational only.)",
